    "text": "15 hours ago Looking for some great free finds around Slidell ? This week’s list includes home items, furniture, and even a fun interactive toy for kids. Check out what your neighbors are giving away!\nFree Ceiling Fan A used ceiling fan in fair condition is available for free pickup . Perfect if you’re updating a room or need a spare fan. Message the poster for the exact address.\nLocation: Slidell, LA Source: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook Red Shag Rug – Heavy and Needs Cleaning This large red shag rug is free to anyone who can haul it away. It’s used and needs cleaning , but could be a great find for a big space. Bring a truck and some help—it’s heavy!\nLocation: Slidell, LA Source: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook Curb Alert – Eddie Bauer High Chair A curb alert for an Eddie Bauer high chair that needs some work and cleaning. Free to anyone who wants to fix it up.\nLocation: Slidell, LA Source: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook Free Office Chair – Pickup Only Grab a used office chair in fair condition. Great for a home office or study space. Pickup only , so message the poster for details.\nLocation: Slidell, LA Source: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook Large Stockpile & Garage Sale in Eden Isles A multi-family sale happening Saturday, April 18th at 7:30am at 360 Moonraker Dr., Slidell . Expect personal care items, baby clothes, toys, and home goods —some free, others deeply discounted. No early birds, please!\nLocation: Davis Landing, Slidell, LA Source: Nextdoor\n👉 See this post on Nextdoor",
